{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32213","headline":"寒食日作 · 温庭筠","name":"寒食日作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"红深绿暗迳相交，抱暖含芳披紫袍。\n彩索平时墙婉娩，轻球落处晚寥梢。\n窗中草色妬鸡卵，盘上芹泥憎燕巢。\n自有玉楼春意在，不能骑马度烟郊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}